      "label": "jewish bunk beds metaphor",
      "description": "This is a derogatory metaphor used in the meme to imply that Jewish people are cheap or overly efficient, by comparing double-stacked ovens (which are seen as space-saving and cost-effective) to 'bunk beds,' which are associated with frugality and minimalism. The metaphor is offensive and relies on antisemitic stereotypes.",
